Sensor register tables of the S5K4ECGX (rear) and the SR200PC20M (front),
taken from the stock camera HAL with tools/camtables.py --firmware. They are
proprietary and never part of the public tree. Release builds carry them in
the vendor image at /vendor/firmware/<sensor>/ (device.mk, from
proprietary/camera on the build host), where the kernel drivers request
them; without them the cameras do not start.
